{"seq":23,"slug":"quantum-computing","title":"量子计算","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":15,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/quantum-computing","rating":{"composite":3.79,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.27,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"量子计算\">量子计算</h1><p>量子计算（Quantum Computing）是利用量子力学原理（superposition、entanglement、interference）执行计算的新范式——经典计算机用 0/1 bit，量子计算机用 qubit 同时处于 0 和 1 的叠加态。1981 Feynman 提出&quot;量子计算机模拟量子系统&quot;，1994 Shor 给出多项式时间分解大整数算法（破 RSA），2019 Google &quot;quantum supremacy&quot; 在 200 秒完成经典超级计算机 10000 年的任务，2024 IBM Heron 1121 qubit、Quantinuum 56 qubit 100% fidelity，让量子计算从理论变成早期实战。本 Hub 给软件工程师 / 数学好奇者一个工程化路径——量子基础（qubit、纠缠、测量）、门 + 电路、Shor / Grover 等核心算法、纠错与硬件现状。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[量子计算] --&gt; B[1. 量子计算基础]&#10;    A --&gt; C[2. 量子门与电路]&#10;    A --&gt; D[3. 量子算法]&#10;    A --&gt; E[4. 量子纠错与应用]&#10;    B --&gt; F[Qubit / 叠加 / 纠缠 / 测量]&#10;    C --&gt; G[X/H/CNOT / 电路 / 隐形传态]&#10;    D --&gt; H[Deutsch / Shor / Grover / QFT]&#10;    E --&gt; I[退相干 / QEC / Supremacy]\">graph TD\n    A[量子计算] --&gt; B[1. 量子计算基础]\n    A --&gt; C[2. 量子门与电路]\n    A --&gt; D[3. 量子算法]\n    A --&gt; E[4. 量子纠错与应用]\n    B --&gt; F[Qubit / 叠加 / 纠缠 / 测量]\n    C --&gt; G[X/H/CNOT / 电路 / 隐形传态]\n    D --&gt; H[Deutsch / Shor / Grover / QFT]\n    E --&gt; I[退相干 / QEC / Supremacy]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>核心概念</th>\n<th>应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>量子基础</td>\n<td>Qubit、superposition、entanglement</td>\n<td>概念奠基</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量子门与电路</td>\n<td>Pauli/Hadamard、CNOT、电路模型</td>\n<td>量子编程基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量子算法</td>\n<td>Shor、Grover、QFT、phase estimation</td>\n<td>破密、搜索、模拟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>量子纠错与应用</td>\n<td>退相干、surface code、硬件平台</td>\n<td>实用化路径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>学完本 Hub 你将能解释&quot;为什么 Shor 算法破 RSA&quot;、&quot;叠加态与经典概率分布的区别&quot;、&quot;量子纠错如何防退相干&quot;、&quot;目前量子计算机能做什么 + 不能做什么&quot;、&quot;post-quantum 密码学的必要性&quot;。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"quantum-foundations","title":"量子计算基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/quantum-computing/quantum-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"qubit-and-superposition","title":"Qubit 与叠加态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/quantum-computing/quantum-foundations/qubit-and-superposition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"entanglement","title":"量子纠缠","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/quantum-computing/quantum-foundations/entanglement"},{"seq":3,"slug":"measurement-and-no-cloning","title":"测量与不可克隆定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/quantum-computing/quantum-foundations/measurement-and-no-cloning"},{"seq":4,"slug":"bloch-sphere","title":"Bloch 球","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/quantum-computing/quantum-foundations/bloch-sphere"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"quantum-gates-and-circuits","title":"量子门与电路","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/quantum-computing/quantum-gates-and-circuits","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"single-qubit-gates","title":"单 qubit 门","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/quantum-computing/quantum-gates-and-circuits/single-qubit-gates"},{"seq":2,"slug":"multi-qubit-gates","title":"多 qubit 门","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/quantum-computing/quantum-gates-and-circuits/multi-qubit-gates"},{"seq":3,"slug":"circuit-model","title":"量子电路模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/quantum-computing/quantum-gates-and-circuits/circuit-model"},{"seq":4,"slug":"quantum-teleportation","title":"量子隐形传态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/quantum-computing/quantum-gates-and-circuits/quantum-teleportation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"quantum-algorithms","title":"量子算法","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/quantum-computing/quantum-algorithms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"deutsch-jozsa","title":"Deutsch-Jozsa 算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/c